        {
          "title": "Habitats",
          "lines": [
            "Hightower entrance chamber"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A small ordinary rat from the flooded nest inside Hightower."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Senses",
          "lines": [
            "Low-light vision",
            "Scent"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Skills",
          "lines": [
            "Balance +10",
            "Climb +12",
            "Hide +14",
            "Move Silently +10",
            "Swim +10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Attacks",
          "lines": [
            "Bite · melee · +4 to hit · 1d3−4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Base creature rules mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Climbing and swimming · The rat uses Dexterity for Climb and Swim checks. It can take 10 on either check even when threatened and can run while swimming in a straight line."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Encounters mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Rat Race · Encounter Level 2. After everyone arrives in area 2, trigger the scene at the DM’s chosen time. Lightning floods a nest, and eight rats run in looking for an exit. Four have 2 HP each and four have 1 HP each. Each is CR 1/8.",
            "Flooded nest tactics · They attack the nearest targets they see, with at most three rats on one target. The bite still deals at least 1 damage. A rat that survives a hit flees on its next move action."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "The 3.5 Monster Manual p. 278 supplies the Tiny Animal base. Weapon Finesse. Space 2½ feet, reach 0 feet.",
            "A Dark and Stormy Knight (Wizards of the Coast, 2005), p. 5 supplies the eight individual HP values and tactics."
          ]
        }
      ],
